{"name":"Correspondence","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/correspondence.png","system":{"description":"<p>Correspondence opened space to you before anything else, and space has never closed again.</p><h3>Perception</h3><p>Your level 1 Correspondence rolls gain +2 dice, and maintaining a perception effect does not use your concentration slot. This applies only while Correspondence works alone; when combined with another Sphere, the Gift does not apply.</p><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Correspondence effects by rolling Arete plus an Attribute chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>The difficulty to hit you increases by Arete plus an Attribute chosen by the Storyteller. Anyone targeting you finds you slightly displaced.</p><h3>Range</h3><p>Gain automatic Range successes equal to Arete on any Magick roll.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-correspondence","source":{"book":"M5 - Settima facciata: Il Dono","page":"7"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-correspondence"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"correspondence","intro":"Correspondence opened space to you before anything else, and space has never closed again.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<p>Your level 1 Correspondence rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>. This applies only while Correspondence works alone.</p>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Correspondence effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p>The difficulty to hit you increases by <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller. Anyone targeting you finds you slightly displaced.</p>"},{"id":"range","label":"Range","kind":"scope","description":"<p>Gain automatic <strong>Range</strong> successes equal to <strong>Arete</strong> on any Magick roll.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereCorr01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Entropy","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/entropy.png","system":{"description":"<p>Entropy first taught you that things give way, and ever since they also give way when you need them to.</p><h3>Perception</h3><p>Your level 1 Entropy rolls gain +2 dice, and maintaining a perception effect does not use your concentration slot. This applies only while Entropy works alone.</p><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Entropy effects by rolling Arete plus an Attribute chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>Once per turn, force an opponent who rolled against you to reroll with -2 dice, or reroll one of your own non-Magick defensive rolls with +2 dice. This refreshes at the beginning of your turn.</p><h3>Conditions</h3><p>Gain automatic Conditions successes equal to Arete on any Magick roll. A secondary effect counts as two.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-entropy","source":{"book":"M5 - Settima facciata: Il Dono","page":"14"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-entropy"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"entropy","intro":"Entropy first taught you that things give way, and ever since they also give way when you need them to.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<p>Your level 1 Entropy rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>. This applies only while Entropy works alone.</p>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Entropy effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p>Once per turn, force an opponent who rolled against you to reroll with <strong>-2 dice</strong>, or reroll one of your own non-Magick defensive rolls with <strong>+2 dice</strong>. This refreshes at the beginning of your turn.</p>"},{"id":"conditions","label":"Conditions","kind":"scope","description":"<p>Gain automatic <strong>Conditions</strong> successes equal to <strong>Arete</strong> on any Magick roll. A secondary effect counts as two.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereEntr01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Forces","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/forces.png","system":{"description":"<p>Forces called to you through a storm or a candle, and ever since energy has recognized you.</p><h3>Perception</h3><p>Your level 1 Forces rolls gain +2 dice, and maintaining a perception effect does not use your concentration slot. This applies only while Forces works alone.</p><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Forces effects by rolling Arete plus Stamina; Forces effects always inflict physical damage.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>Reduce damage from any blow by Arete plus an Attribute chosen by the Storyteller according to how you resist it.</p><h3>Potency</h3><p>Gain automatic Potency successes equal to Arete on any Magick roll.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-forces","source":{"book":"M5 - Settima facciata: Il Dono","page":"21"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-forces"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"forces","intro":"Forces called to you through a storm or a candle, and ever since energy has recognized you.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<p>Your level 1 Forces rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>. This applies only while Forces works alone.</p>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Forces effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus Stamina</strong>; Forces effects always inflict physical damage.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p><strong>Reduce damage</strong> from any blow by <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller according to how you resist it.</p>"},{"id":"potency","label":"Potency","kind":"scope","description":"<p>Gain automatic <strong>Potency</strong> successes equal to <strong>Arete</strong> on any Magick roll.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereForc01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Life","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/life.png","system":{"description":"<p>Life called to you first through beasts or bodies, and ever since your flesh has argued back.</p><h3>Perception</h3><p>Your level 1 Life rolls gain +2 dice, and maintaining a perception effect does not use your concentration slot. This applies only while Life works alone.</p><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Life effects by rolling Arete plus Stamina; Life effects always inflict physical damage.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>When you suffer physical damage, roll Arete plus Stamina to soak it. Each success absorbs one Superficial damage; every two absorb one Aggravated. Spending 1 Quintessence makes each success absorb two Superficial or one Aggravated.</p><h3>Health</h3><p>Regenerate Health equal to Arete each turn. You resist disease and poison and can heal unnatural wounds. Spending Quintessence also restores Aggravated damage and missing body parts.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-life","source":{"book":"M5 - Settima facciata: Il Dono","page":"63"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-life"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"life","intro":"Life called to you first through beasts or bodies, and ever since your flesh has argued back.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<p>Your level 1 Life rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>. This applies only while Life works alone.</p>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Life effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus Stamina</strong>; Life effects always inflict physical damage.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p>When you suffer physical damage, roll <strong>Arete plus Stamina</strong> to soak it. Each success absorbs one Superficial damage; every two absorb one Aggravated. Spending <strong>1 Quintessence</strong> makes each success absorb two Superficial or one Aggravated.</p>"},{"id":"health","label":"Health","kind":"track","description":"<p><strong>Regenerate Health equal to Arete each turn</strong>. You resist disease and poison and can heal unnatural wounds. Spending Quintessence also restores Aggravated damage and missing body parts.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereLife01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Matter","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/matter.png","system":{"description":"<p>Matter first showed you what things are made of, and ever since things have stood on your side.</p><h3>Perception</h3><p>Your level 1 Matter rolls gain +2 dice, and maintaining a perception effect does not use your concentration slot. This applies only while Matter works alone.</p><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Matter effects by rolling Arete plus an Attribute chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>You have armor dice equal to your Sphere rating plus Arete. They are tied to an object in your hand capable of parrying the blow, and break as the object breaks.</p><h3>Area</h3><p>Gain automatic Area successes equal to Arete on any Magick roll.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-matter","source":{"book":"M5 - Settima facciata: Il Dono","page":"28"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-matter"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"matter","intro":"Matter first showed you what things are made of, and ever since things have stood on your side.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<p>Your level 1 Matter rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>. This applies only while Matter works alone.</p>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Matter effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p>You have <strong>armor dice equal to your Sphere rating plus Arete</strong>. They are tied to an object in your hand capable of parrying the blow, and break as the object breaks.</p>"},{"id":"area","label":"Area","kind":"scope","description":"<p>Gain automatic <strong>Area</strong> successes equal to <strong>Arete</strong> on any Magick roll.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereMatt01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Mind","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/mind.png","system":{"description":"<p>Mind first opened the door of thought to you, and ever since yours has been a locked room.</p><h3>Perception</h3><p>Your level 1 Mind rolls gain +2 dice, and maintaining a perception effect does not use your concentration slot. This applies only while Mind works alone.</p><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Mind effects by rolling Arete plus Resolve; Mind effects always inflict mental damage.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>When you suffer mental damage, roll Arete plus Resolve to soak it. Each success absorbs one Superficial damage; every two absorb one Aggravated. Spending 1 Quintessence makes each success absorb two Superficial or one Aggravated. This never applies to damage caused by rerolling dice.</p><h3>Willpower</h3><p>Regenerate Willpower equal to Arete each turn. Spending Quintessence also restores Aggravated Willpower damage and lost memories.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-mind","source":{"book":"M5 - Settima facciata: Il Dono","page":"35"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-mind"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"mind","intro":"Mind first opened the door of thought to you, and ever since yours has been a locked room.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<p>Your level 1 Mind rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>. This applies only while Mind works alone.</p>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Mind effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus Resolve</strong>; Mind effects always inflict mental damage.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p>When you suffer mental damage, roll <strong>Arete plus Resolve</strong> to soak it. Each success absorbs one Superficial damage; every two absorb one Aggravated. Spending <strong>1 Quintessence</strong> improves absorption. Damage caused by rerolling dice cannot be soaked this way.</p>"},{"id":"willpower","label":"Willpower","kind":"track","description":"<p><strong>Regenerate Willpower equal to Arete each turn</strong>. Spending Quintessence also restores Aggravated Willpower damage and lost memories.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereMind01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Prime","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/prime.png","system":{"description":"<p>Prime first showed you what everything else is made of, and ever since your spark has burned from within.</p><h3>Perception</h3><p>Your level 1 Prime rolls gain +2 dice, and maintaining a perception effect does not use your concentration slot. This applies only while Prime works alone.</p><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Prime effects by rolling Arete plus an Attribute chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>Reduce the successes of a power or Magick effect cast on you by rolling the same Attribute and Ability pool used by its caster. If it falls below the threshold, the effect is nullified. Once per turn.</p><h3>Targets</h3><p>Gain automatic Targets successes equal to Arete on any Magick roll.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-prime","source":{"book":"M5 - Settima facciata: Il Dono","page":"42"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-prime"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"prime","intro":"Prime first showed you what everything else is made of, and ever since your spark has burned from within.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<p>Your level 1 Prime rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>. This applies only while Prime works alone.</p>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Prime effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p><strong>Reduce the successes</strong> of a power or Magick effect cast on you by rolling the same Attribute and Ability pool used by its caster. If it falls below the threshold, the effect is nullified. Once per turn.</p>"},{"id":"targets","label":"Targets","kind":"scope","description":"<p>Gain automatic <strong>Targets</strong> successes equal to <strong>Arete</strong> on any Magick roll.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSpherePrim01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Spirit","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/spirit.png","system":{"description":"<p>Spirit first carried you beyond, and ever since part of you has remained on the threshold.</p><h3>Perception</h3><p>Your level 1 Spirit rolls gain +2 dice, and maintaining a perception effect does not use your concentration slot. This applies only while Spirit works alone.</p><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Spirit effects by rolling Arete plus an Attribute chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>When you suffer Stains, you are always considered to have at least one active Conviction: you may still make the defense roll, and Aggravated damage requires the star result. This does not apply when you violate one of your own Convictions.</p><h3>Wisdom</h3><p>You heal Superficial Stains without assistance: remove 1 at the beginning of each session.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-spirit","source":{"book":"M5 - Settima facciata: Il Dono","page":"49"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-spirit"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"spirit","intro":"Spirit first carried you beyond, and ever since part of you has remained on the threshold.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<p>Your level 1 Spirit rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>. This applies only while Spirit works alone.</p>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Spirit effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p>When you suffer Stains, you are <strong>always considered to have at least one active Conviction</strong>: you may still make the defense roll, and Aggravated damage requires the star result. This does not apply when you violate one of your own Convictions.</p>"},{"id":"wisdom","label":"Wisdom","kind":"track","description":"<p>You <strong>heal Superficial Stains without assistance</strong>: remove <strong>1 at the beginning of each session</strong>.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereSpir01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Time","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/time.png","system":{"description":"<p>Time first told you that it was flowing, and you already knew it at twelve without having the words.</p><h3>Perception</h3><p>Your level 1 Time rolls gain +2 dice, and maintaining a perception effect does not use your concentration slot. This applies only while Time works alone.</p><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Time effects by rolling Arete plus an Attribute chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>You cannot be caught off guard, you always act first, and your guard is never halved while weaving: you have already seen the blow coming.</p><h3>Duration</h3><p>Gain automatic Duration successes equal to Arete on any Magick roll.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-time","source":{"book":"M5 - Settima facciata: Il Dono","page":"56"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-time"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"time","intro":"Time first told you that it was flowing, and you already knew it at twelve without having the words.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<p>Your level 1 Time rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>. This applies only while Time works alone.</p>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Time effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p>You cannot be caught off guard, <strong>you always act first</strong>, and your <strong>guard is never halved</strong> while weaving: you have already seen the blow coming.</p>"},{"id":"duration","label":"Duration","kind":"scope","description":"<p>Gain automatic <strong>Duration</strong> successes equal to <strong>Arete</strong> on any Magick roll.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereTime01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
